' SamPr Basic - WINDOW: coordinate con origine al centro
COLOR 15, 1
SCREEN 5
CLS
WINDOW (-160, -100)-(160, 100)
LINE (-160, 0)-(160, 0), 14
LINE (0, -100)-(0, 100), 14
FOR x = -150 TO 150 STEP 2
  y = (x * x) / 200 - 50
  PSET (x, y), 10
NEXT x
CIRCLE (0, 0), 40, 8
CIRCLE (0, 0), 40, 12, 0, 90
PAINT (10, 10), 3, 12
